--

COMMENT ON COLUMN public.rounds.base_pool_kobo IS 'The exact sum of this round''s paid, non-superseded contributions. For a ten-member Ajo at NGN 1,000.00 this is 1000000 kobo = NGN 10,000.00, and it is the only figure that may be paid out. Maintained by a deferred trigger, so it cannot disagree with the contributions that produced it.';


